('e2910000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid,'{"correct_option_id":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013"}'::jsonb,'120×80=9 600 piksel. 24 bit=3 bayt. 9 600×3=28 800 bayt. Faylning haqiqiy disk hajmi format/metama’lumotga bog‘liq.'),
('e2910000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002'::uuid,'{"correct_option_id":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000021"}'::jsonb,'SVG geometrik yo‘l/obyektlar bilan ishlaydi; konturlarni o‘lchamdan mustaqil qayta hisoblash mumkin. JPEG/BMP/GIF esa asosan rastr modeliga tayangan.'),
('e2910000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003'::uuid,'{"correct_option_id":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000034"}'::jsonb,'Ekranda RGB yorug‘likka asoslanadi, bosmada esa ko‘pincha CMYK bo‘yoq modeli ishlatiladi. Bosma profil/gamut farqi sabab ko‘rinish o‘zgarishi mumkin.'),
('e2910000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004'::uuid,'{"correct_option_id":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000042"}'::jsonb,'Eni 960, bo‘yi 540 bo‘ladi. Jami 960×540=518 400 piksel. Ikki o‘lchamning har biri yarmiga tushsa umumiy piksel soni to‘rt baravar kamayadi.'),
('e2910000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005'::uuid,'{"pairs":{"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000051":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000057","e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000052":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000055","e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000053":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000058","e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000054":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000056"}}'::jsonb,'SVG geometrik manba; PSD qatlamli loyiha; PNG alpha va lossless; JPEG fotolar uchun keng qo‘llanadigan yo‘qotishli eksport. Bular bir vazifani bajarmaydi.'),
