('e2910000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007'::uuid,'{"correct_option_id":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000073"}'::jsonb,'Crop berilgan 600×500 maydon tashqarisini tashlaydi; qolgan rastr 600×500=300 000 piksel. Bu resize emas.'),
