('e2910000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009'::uuid,'{"correct_option_id":"e2920000-0000-4000-8000-000000000094"}'::jsonb,'Bosmadagi eni=piksel eni/PPI=900/300=3 dyuym (taxminan 7,62 sm). Faqat metadata PPI ni o‘zgartirish yangi tafsilot yaratmaydi.'),
